{"about_the_game":"<strong>Handcrafted Levels.</strong> <br>Flow has 100 handcrafted levels. Equations get longer, operations become more complex but everyone has a unique way to solve a problem. Because the essence of algorithms lies in their freedom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/747810/extras/5a018d543650122bd5dbd0436ed30127.poster.avif?t=1644565478\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/747810/extras/5a018d543650122bd5dbd0436ed30127.webm?t=1644565478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/747810/extras/5a018d543650122bd5dbd0436ed30127.mp4?t=1644565478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Infinite mode.</strong><br>There is an infinite mode that creates levels procedurally with three different difficulties. So whenever you want to challenge your mind in a relaxing setting, you can open up Flow and play even after you complete all the handcrafted levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/747810/extras/113d03ef0bee405bb43111a0ebfba906.poster.avif?t=1644565478\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/747810/extras/113d03ef0bee405bb43111a0ebfba906.webm?t=1644565478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/747810/extras/113d03ef0bee405bb43111a0ebfba906.mp4?t=1644565478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1f3d8cedd5674f5c852341b3f202b984d7b72843.jpg","localized_name":"Level 1 is done.","name":"Level 1 is done.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/imag